<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">- Ekajuk New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Jems</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jems</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jems</para>
  <para style="mt2">NWER NYI</para>
  <para style="mt1">JEMS</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Me Jems ji li nlokeltum Esowo, a no Ntul a Jisos Kraist, n kpꞌkake ewubu etꞌtohngo ebbal bi Israel nnyo, bi ma yaame.<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eltaame, a elkahne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Abonanee, jo bumen ana ejum eyebatahng, ngare anyehng anyehng nyi ń lꞌjo yel go elgaare ni li nkohn a nkohn. <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />Tibre ń kpꞌkahne re, elwuungu ni bo kpo wuungu eltaame enahne, ni ni kpo ko elkpuumu ba a ni. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Nongen, elkpuumu nio lim eltum ni nno go egahne atahng, eji ń lꞌjol go nseenga nseenge, fere bel ejum ajehng ajehng eji ejum ajehng ajehng lꞌki-n jo rin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 5:3-5; 1 Pit 1:6-7</char></note><verse eid="JAS 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Nne awohng awohng no elkahne lꞌrin-e, nong, á bahb Esowo, á bahke bele.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 7:7</char></note> Tibre Esowo kpo wehr abo, ka ane kpee, jol á kpehme memme. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Nong, á bahb, jo bum Esowo go etingitingi, kꞌfaabe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 11:24</char></note> Tibre nne no lꞌfaabe, á li ana ebuku ji nfeb kpꞌyehke tv edi ajehng ajehng. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Nong, elkohn nne noo kꞌtir re, á bahke bele ejum goji Esowo. <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />Tibre á li nne no kil kahme ejum ajehng lim, á kpꞌdulu na dulu go ejum ajehng ajehng.<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ekpak, a afang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Nong, mmonannee no li nkpak geere, tib eji Esowo m-e mehl wahre. <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />Nong, efange nne tob geere, eji Esowo m-e rede.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 7:21-22</char></note> Tibre á bahke kpoko ana afem ajele.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 1:24</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Njul kpo ya, fere jo fꞌfub, fere fi ajele. Afem enye kum, ano enye mal. Mbang nyꞌnehm nyi efange nne bahke daade ngare nyi á kpꞌlimi nsol enye.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bade elgaare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Elfuulu li a nne no kpo kpuumu elgaare. Tibre eji á ma yiimi go elgaare nio, á bahke bele ekpasi ntul ji elkpin,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Tim 4:7-8</char></note> ji Esowo ma nyam tong ane re bo bahke bele, ba ye kpi bo kor. <verse eid="JAS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Elgaare lꞌba a nne, nong, á kꞌjo tong re, “Esowo bi kp-m gare.” Tibre nnene limm, no bahke ma gare Esowo re, Esowo lim ebi. Yefono antahng kpehme gare nne re, á lim ebi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Tim 2:4</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Nne awohng awohng kpo bel elgaare tib go nsol nyi kpo mell-e go eltim, nyi kpo wer-e, fere yehk-e tahm a ne. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Nsol nyio bahke sake ela, jel abiafem. Eji abiafem ma gbal mal, jen elkv.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 2:16-17</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Akor-m abonanee, kana taame, bo nehm-n. <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Ejum ajehng ajehng ji nno, a ayare nya nno a nno kpee kpo lohng go ero goji Esowo ba, ye ji limi ellennge. Á kpehme yaange. Jol ellennge ene kpehme gbo ejannge ajehng ajehng. Tibre Esowo kpehme yaange alum enye.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 1:5</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Ana á toobo no wo, á jel-r no tib go alum nya li go etingitingi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 1:13; 1 Pit 1:23</char></note> eji e lꞌjol agbokombang go ellong ane ebe ba li nfenfe.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elwuku, a ellimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Akor-m abonanee, nong, nne awohng awohng jo ware elwuku, á kꞌjo ware go elbungu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 12:36</char></note> á kꞌjo gulu atahng rak. <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />Tibre erakatahng kpehme lim nne re á li eno go esamahr bi Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 4:26</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Owo fvfo, nobo re wahn yake nsol nyi ki li saang, a abꞌbi nya ma tv na tv, wahn fere ko alum nya Esowo go eltim ni li reed, nya Esowo ma bahm go egahne atahng, nya bahke ma tahre atohko enyahne.<verse eid="JAS 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Jo limen ana alum Esowo bungu no, nya ḿ ma wuk. Kana jol abawꞌwuku ba ba, ba kpo nehm elbo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 7:21</char></note><verse eid="JAS 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Tibre nne awohng awohng no lꞌwuk alum nyao, kꞌfere lim, á li ana nne no seenge go enyehn, nyehn elne. <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />Eji á ma nyehn elne, á kehm tahme eje, soro yini ana á li no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 3:10</char></note><verse eid="JAS 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Nne no lꞌfahng go ntahm nyi li go nseenga nseenge,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 13:34</char></note> nyi kpo lim nne, á for, á lꞌfere soro asi, jo lim ano, á lꞌjol nlꞌlimi no kpꞌlohko lim, kꞌjol nne no kpo wuk, fere yini, á bahke bele elfuulu go nsol nyi á kpꞌlimi. <verse eid="JAS 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Nne awohng awohng no lꞌtir re, ye kpꞌkake Esowo, kꞌjo baade nnyo eme,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kol 4:6</char></note> á kpi elne nehm na. Elkake ni á kpꞌkake Esowo li mbol mbol.<verse eid="JAS 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />A wo li mbang nyi Esowo akake nyi li saang, nyi elem ajehng ajehng ki li go esamahr Esowo Nso ejahre. Nne bahke jo kpur abon nkubin, a akalebun ba kpꞌnyehne erem, fere jo bum elne saang, eji á lꞌkꞌbel edehbe abiafem ajehng ajehng ji njini.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s">Erehke ji li bade ane arange</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Abonanee, eji ḿ ma taame tv Jisos Kraist Ntul ewahre no li Ntul no kpi ellub, kana jo rang ane. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Nne lꞌfere kak ebil agul, fere liibi anoobo nsol, ba yel go egahne ekpꞌkpa ero, nkpak nyi kake ajakensol tob ba yel, <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />ń lꞌfere gbaame nne no liibi anoobo nsol, fere tong-e re, “Ba ji a,” fere tong nkpak re, “Yiimi o!” tohko jol ano ń tong-e re, “Ji go elka ndi kohlo eti ejame,” <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />ń lꞌlim ano, ń ka rang na ane oa?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 10:34-35</char></note> Ń ka jol na ane ba kpꞌlame ane a ebi ntir atahnga?<verse eid="JAS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Wuungen atung, akor-m abonanee, Esowo ebyehke ane ba li akpak go njini nyia re bo gbo afang nya li eltaame ni bo ma taame tv-e, fere li etul ebe ana ejum elehke elkv ebo, ji á nyame tong ane re bo bahke bele, ba ye kpi bo kor.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 12:21; 1 Kor 1:26-29</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Wahn ebdaange nkpak. Anv, afang ane sang kpo fil-n nyaame nyaama, fere jo tohng-n tahm a nahne go esuba? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Anv, bo sang li ane ba kpo bung abꞌbi bada nnooba mbing nyi Esowo ma-n kaa?<verse eid="JAS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Etingitingi, ń lꞌbum ntahm nyi Ntul ana nwer Esowo bungu no re, “Nne ebjing ewa jo kor-a ana ebjing eba,” no ń kpꞌlimi nob nob.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 7:12</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Wo, ń lꞌjo rang ane, wahn eblim abiafem. Atahm bahke tibi re, wahn abagbokatahm ba. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Nne awohng awohng no lꞌbum atahm kpee, fere soodo anyehng, yebgbo atahm kpee. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Tibre nonehm o no bungu re, “Ka lim erehbe!” ye jꞌnehm wo tob bung re, “Ka wul nne!” A tohko lim erehbe, a lꞌfere wul nne, wobjol ngbokatahm.<verse eid="JAS 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Jo bungen, wahn fere jo lim eljini ni ane ba Esowo bahke lame bo ana ntahm bungu no nyi kpo lim ane for. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Tibre ngare nyi Esowo bahke lame ane, nne no ane ki-e jo fili ndon, á nehm fili Esowo ndon. Fvfo, ndon nyi kpo wahng elam kane.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 5:7; 18:32-34</char></note><verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana nne bahke jo tib eltaame ene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Abonanee, nsehng anyi nne bahke lehke, á lꞌtong re á kpꞌtaame tv Esowo, kꞌtib eljini ni eltaame? Anv, elkohn eltaame ana nio bahk-e ma tahra?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 7:26</char></note><verse eid="JAS 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Lꞌjol re mmonanne kpimm nsol ebjing, a nyi ellehke, <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />nne awohng ewahne kehm-e tongo re, “Esowo fuul-a, nong, alohk ki-a fili, wo jo li nsol nob nob”, kꞌfere ka-e nsol nyi m-e lehng, nsehng anyi li li o fono?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 3:17-18</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Ano wo fvfo tob li ka nne no kpꞌtaame, kꞌtib eljini ni eltaame. Eltaame ene, ekpakv eltaame ni.<verse eid="JAS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Nne nondiki li ma bung re, “Ane bandiki kpꞌtaame go nnyo, ane bako kpꞌlimi eljini ni eltaame.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 2:18">Elkohn nne noo m bahk-e faange re, “A bahk-m ma tib eltaame ena renan, eji a kil jo lim eljini ni eltaame? M bahk-a tibi eljini ename, a kahn eltaame ename.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 5:6</char></note><verse eid="JAS 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />A kpꞌtaame re, li Esowo na abehng. Ano nꞌnob. Jol abi atohko fvfo kpꞌtob taame ano, fere jo kꞌkahm.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mak 3:11; 5:7</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Egboolo nne, anv, a kpꞌsebe re me n tib-a re, nne no kpꞌtaame, kꞌbel eljini ni eltaame, eltaame ene, ekpakv eltaame nia? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Ebraham nso ejahre li eno go esamahr bi Esowo tib go ejum ji á limi no, eji á rodo Aisik mmon ewe, song lim njom.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 11:17-19</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />A nehme nyehn re, eljini ene jo jene ano a eltaame enea? Eljini ni nne kpo lim, ni ni kpo lim eltaame ene re jol go nseenge. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />Owo wahnge edi nwer Esowo jia kehm jolo go etingitingi, ji bungu re, “Ebraham taame tv Esowo. Eltaame ene ni wahnge Esowo fang-e kak go ellong ane ba ma li eno go ege esamahr.” Bo fere jo lung-e re ntem no Esowo. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Ń kpꞌnyehne re, nne, Esowo kpo ka-e eno tib go nsol nyi á kpꞌlimi, eltaame ni ni sang. <verse eid="JAS 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Tob jolo ano jang jang a Rehab ji jolo nnenkal asꞌsa. Á li eno go esamahr bi Esowo tib go ejum ji á limi no, eji á vvrv aneb Jus ba bo tumu bo, á kake bo ebo, bo sehng mbang nyindiki, be ebo tahm.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 11:31</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Ana ngubjing nyi ki kpi etohko li ekpakv, ano wo tob li bada nne no kpꞌtaame, kꞌtib eljini ni eltaame. Eltaame ene, ekpakv eltaame ni.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s">Bade ebliki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Abonanee, nong, wahn kꞌjo ra eltibi. Tibre ń kpꞌkahne re, wahr atꞌtibi, wahr ba, elam bahke ga bib a nahre.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 12:48; Mat 12:36-37</char></note><verse eid="JAS 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Tibre wahr ane kpee e kpo kono elsoodo ngare anyehng anyehng. Nne awohng awohng no tohko jo soodo go ege alum nnyo, á li go nseenga nseenge. Á bahke ma tob jo fili ngubjing enye kpe kpe.<verse eid="JAS 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />E lꞌkak mmokuungu go nnyo enyꞌnya, eji á lꞌwuk-r, e bahke ma jo soongo enyꞌnya kohro kohro. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Tob nyehnen asohkkahng fvfo, ana kpꞌgbale. Egburu nfeb kpo yehke bo. Mmonsꞌsohko ejum ana nso nyi bo kpo ko soongo. Edi ajehng ajehng ji nfꞌfingi lꞌsoongo tv, owo nsohkkahng bahke jeke. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Ano wo fvfo ebliki li no. Li mmonsꞌsohko ejum. Li ma wor nnyo bade ajꞌjok nsol, jang jang ana mmotoongo agun bahke ma wahng egburu emahng lul. <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Ebliki li ana agun. Tob li ana njini nyi ma gbal abꞌbi abꞌbi. Ebliki bi li ejum ngubjing ji kpo lim ngubjing kpe kpe sab.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 15:11,18-19</char></note> Ebliki bi kpo jahm elkpin nne, kehm jo lul go agun nya nnehm m-e kak.<verse eid="JAS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Elkohn nnyam anyehng anyehng ana nruk, enyo, a nsahre, ane kpo mal bob bo, ba le bo go etahk. Bo kpo lohko lim ano. <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />Nnene limm, no ma mꞌmal bob ebliki ebe. Ebliki li abꞌbi abꞌbi, bi nnene lꞌkꞌma fili. Ebliki ebrur afa afa nyao nya elkv.<verse eid="JAS 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Ebliki bi e kpo ko tehk Jehova Nso ejahre, fere jo ko su ane ba Esowo limi go ege elfoongo. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Nnyo mꞌnehm mi kpo ka elfuulu, mꞌnehm mi kpo su nne. Abonanee, nong kꞌjo jol ano! <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Anv, esi ebgba bia, bi anoobo alahb kpo lohng semme a ma kpꞌlula? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Abonanee, anv, mmehrekv bahke ma kab akab amangura, afi ejv bahke ma kab akab amehrekv?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 7:16-20</char></note> Ano wo fvfo alahb ma nno lꞌkꞌma lohng go edi ji alahb ma kpꞌlaabe kpꞌlohngo.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nne awo li ekahnkahn nne?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Nne awo li ekahnkahn nne ji kpꞌbange go egahne ellong? Nong, á tib elkahne ene go ege a nnoobo elkpin, fere jo lim nnoobo go eltim ni li reed. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Ń lꞌjol maange maange, ala fere jo teel-n, ń fere jo tiiri elnahne elnahne, kana jo wor nnyo re, ń kpi elkahne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 4:31</char></note> Kana jo kiimi afahnge lake etingitingi.<verse eid="JAS 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Elkohn elkahne ana nia lohngem go ero ba, li ni njini, a ni ngubjing, a ni nnehm. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Tibre edi ji ane kpi eteelala, fere jo tiiri elbo, ji ji kpo jol jokko jokko jokko, elkohn ebꞌbi ajehng ajehng wob ona. <verse eid="JAS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Elkahne ni lohng go ero ni a. Ngbokambang, li saang, kpi elkoono seb, li soom, esi kpehme tahne, kpi ndon gbalee, a akab nya nno, nfaabe anyehng anyehng limm, awini limm.<verse eid="JAS 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Nkab eti nyio nyi ellimi go etingitingi, bobbahm go ntim ane ba kpo lim ane koono.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 5:9</char></note><verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s">Etem alimi a njini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Ejum aji wahnge nta kpo gbo? Ejum aji wahnge ntaange kpo gbo go egahne ellong? Kpo lohng go nsol nyi kpo sahb mell-n melle go egahne ntim, fere jo nok go egahne atahng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 2:11</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Ń kpo sahb sꞌseb nsol, wo, ń kpehme bel. Owo wahnge ń kpo wul ane. Ń kpo baare amahr go nsol ane, ń kpehme bel. Owo wahnge ń kpo nok abohng, fere nok nta. Ń kpehme bel, tibre ń kpehme bahb. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Ń kpo bahb, ń kpehme bel, tibre ń kpo bahb go ebi mbang. Ń kpo bahb nsol re wahn ko, jo lim ji kor-n no go egahna ntim.<verse eid="JAS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Wahn abalimerehbe baa, ń nehme kahn re, ń lꞌlim etem a njini, wahn anebekv ba Esowo baa? Fvfo, nne no lꞌseb re á jol ntem no njini, yebrod elne bum ana nnekv no Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 2:15</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Kana tir re, edi nwer Esowo jia li mbol mbol, ji Esowo bungu re, “Etohko ji Esowo ji wob go egahre atahng, e kp-e sahb tꞌteele ala.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 6:24</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Esowo kpꞌkake nnoobo gbalee budu. Owo wahnge á bungu re,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JAS 4:6">“N kpo ten aneb elgeere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JAS 4:6">fere rod nnoobo enyame ka ane ba ma rede elbo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 23:12</char></note><verse eid="JAS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Owo fvfo nobo re, wahn rede elnahne, woomo Esowo go elwo. Jo tenen nnehm, á bahke beke tahm.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 5:8-9</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Jeeren bade Esowo, Esowo bahke tob jeere bada nahne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 7:8</char></note> Ruun abo enyahne, wahn aneb abiafem! Ruun ntim enyahne, wahn ane ba kpꞌtoono mbang ebal ebal!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Jon 1:9</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Jolen ndon ndon, wahn jo guunu, fere jo ling. Nong, asol enyahne fere siingi elguunu, eyebatahng ejahne fere kpiidi, jo lub-n tamm go egahna ntim.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 6:21</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Jo reden elnahne go esamahr Jehova, á bahk-n mehle wahre.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kana jo lam atemtem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Abonanee, kana jo bung ebꞌbi bade atemtem. Nne no lꞌbung ebꞌbi bada mmonannyehn,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 5:22</char></note> tohko jol ano, á lꞌlam mmonannyehn,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 2:1</char></note> yebbung ebꞌbi bade atahm, fere lam atahm. A lꞌlam atahm, a kpeem li nne no kpo bum atahm, wobjol nne no kpꞌlame atahm. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Esowo bi li njehkatahm, a nlꞌlame,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 14:4</char></note> ye ji kpo mal eltahre, fere rꞌrannge. Anv, wo elkohn nne awo no bahke lame nte ewa?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Erehke ji li bada nnyo aworo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Wuung-m wahn atung, wahn jia ji kpo kono elbungu re, “Lela, tohko jol ano behna, e bahke jeke ejahbe ajehng, owo e bahke lene go elya anehng, jo jen are fere jo lim akpohko.” <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Jol ń nehme kahn ji bahke jolo behna. Anv, elkpin enahne li renan? Li ana ejꞌjohk ji nne bahke ma nyehn mmongare ntiil, fere lamme.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 12:20</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Ji kehn ń jol bungu, li re, “Jehova lꞌtaame, e bahke jolo go elkpin, fere jo lim ajoobo nsol.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 18:21</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Anv, ń kpꞌworo na nnyo, fere jo geere. Elkohn nnyo aworo mio kpee, abꞌbi nya. <verse eid="JAS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Nne awohng awohng no lꞌkahn ji nobo re á lim, kꞌfere lim, yeblim abiafem.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 12:47; Jems 2:15-16</char></note><verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s">Erehke ji li ka afang ane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />N yahke bung a nahne anv, wahn afang ane. Jo lingen, wahn fere jo biingi go egburu erem bi ḿ bahke nyehne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 6:24</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Afang enyahne ebbol. Nsol ebjing enyahne, etan ebwo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 6:19</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Agul enyahne, a asilva enyahne ebbiili amahn. Amahn abiili nyaa nya bahk-n fvvrv yake, fere fi agubjing enyahne ana agun. Tibre wahn ebkpu nsol afang luk esꞌkohro ngare nyia. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Akpohko nya ń ki ka ane ba limi eltum go egahne ebgbe kpꞌrabe. Elrabe ni aneb eltum ebahne jo rabe, Esowo bi li nfono babenjel ebwuk. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Eji ń jolo go njini, ń jo li ebno, fere jo toono elyebe ni njini. Wahn eble elnahne, fere jok, ta afom ana nfong nyi ane kpo le, jo sik efung bi bo bahk-e wulu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 12:20-21; 16:19-25</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Wahn ba lame etingi nne, kim ebi ka-e, fere wul-e. Á kpo yake elne ka-n.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 18:4-11; Hib 10:34</char></note><verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elkpooro, a ero akake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Abonanee, owo fvfo nobo re, wahn kpooro tete Ntul a Jisos ba. Nyehnen ana mbahmgbe kpo kpooro, jo sik anoobo nsol nya á bahke kpake go ege egbe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hib 10:36</char></note> Nya nya wahnge á kpo kpooro sik ngbokambang elahb tete elahb kimi, á song kpa. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Wahn fvfo, tob kpooren! Belen ntim nyi kpꞌtahne. Tibre elbake ni Ntul a Jisos ebkabbe.<verse eid="JAS 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Abonanee, kana jo memme tob atemtem, eji Esowo lꞌki-n lam. Nyehnen, nlꞌlame ga, yim no go mbutahk.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ell 3:20</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Abonanee, leemen eljini ni abanyehnamahr, ni bo jo kpuumu erem, bo jio ji jo bung go mbing nyi Jehova.<verse eid="JAS 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Ane ba jo kpuumu, e kpo lung bo re, aneb eyebatahng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 5:12</char></note> Wahn ebwuk bade elkpuumu ni Job, fere nyehn ji Jehova limi no ka-e go esꞌkohro. Tibre Esowo, ane kpo fil-e ndon, á fere jo kak bo ebo.<verse eid="JAS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Abonanee, ji ga li, li re, wahn kꞌjo tir ejahbetul Esowo, afi jolo njini, afi fere jolo ejum jindikandiki gona. Nong, eltaame enahne ni ń kpꞌtaame jo jol re, “Ee”, tohko jol ano wahn ten re, “Eꞌee”, eji ń lꞌkꞌli ebi go esamahr bi Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 5:34-37</char></note><verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Anv, nne awohng awohng ewahne noa, no kpꞌnyehne erema? Nong, á kak ero. Nne noa, no atahng kp-e yeba? Nong, á yim ase, tehk Esowo. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Anv, nne awohng awohng ewahne noa, no kpꞌyama? Nong, á lung anebkul ero, bo ba kak ero ka-e, fere taam-e akehng go mbing nyi Ntul a Jisos. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Ero eltaame bio bahke tahre nne eyam noo. Jehova bahk-e tabe jehke. Lꞌjol nyi á limi abiafem, Esowo bahke tahme ka-e. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Fvfo, nobo re wahn jo fvvrv abiafem enyahne tong atemtem, fere jo kak ero ka atemtem, eji ń lꞌjo nob go egahne ayam. Ero bi etingi nne Esowo kpo kak kpi egburu nsahm, Esowo kpo fꞌfaange.<verse eid="JAS 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Elaija jolo nne ana wahr. Á kake ero eltim eltim ene re elahb kꞌna. Elahb tikem na go ndi nyio nnya era kunu nnyahng erakera.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 4:25</char></note> <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Á kehm kpe kak ero, Esowo kehm nake elahb. Ndi kehm kpe lim nsol lak.<verse eid="JAS 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Abonanee, nne awohng awohng ewahne no lꞌtan mbang nyi etingitingi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 6:1</char></note> nne noko fere ko-e, feere a ne, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />nong, á kahn re, nne no lꞌyehke nne abiafem go mbang nyi á kpꞌtane asongo, feere a ne, á bahke tahre etohko eje yehke go elkv, fere lim Esowo bulu abiafem tvv.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pit 4:8</char></note><verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>